--- !u!114 &114998354698508981
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1255021648398910}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 1589
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 我与几位长老对神剑进行了仔细的探查，发现其中的魔气聚集成团，而非游离地遍布整把剑，成团的魔气中心还有反应强烈的核心，仿佛是一块灵核......
